  "editorial": "Clients and monitors branch on status codes. Using 200 for every outcome hides failures. The five situations here are the ones a small resource API actually returns. 500 is the leftover for a bug, not for a missing row.",
  "reference_solution": "def solve(situation):\n    return {\"fetched\": 200, \"created\": 201, \"deleted\": 204, \"missing\": 404, \"conflict\": 409}.get(situation, 500)\n"
